{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1199070-contract-of-emotions","id":1199070,"title":"Contract of Emotions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-24T08:35:46-07:00","id":1199070,"title":"Contract of Emotions","content":"Hi all,<br /> <br /> I'm really curious and I just wanted to know something. When we were previewed in the last years about the Courts, there was mention of the Contract of Emotions. Since it's playtest material that didn't make it into the latest incarnation of the game, would somebody in the know be kind enough to share with us the mechanics/what it was?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T14:56:24-07:00","id":1199205,"title":"","content":"They're actually in the newer material as court contracts, similar to 1e's stuff where you had &quot;Cupid's Eye&quot; being for Spring's patron emotion of desire. So they went back to the old way where each court has a line of contracts dedicated to their emotion. The contract of emotions never made it into the original playtest material to begin with, so all we can really do is speculate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5413-icefyer","name":"Icefyer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","va